{"id":31757,"mal_id":31757,"title":"Kizumonogatari II: Nekketsu-hen","englishTitle":"Kizumonogatari Part 2: Hot-Blooded","title_english":"Kizumonogatari Part 2: Hot-Blooded","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Koyomi Vamp","Kizumonogatari Part 2"],"en":"Kizumonogatari Part 2: Hot-Blooded","ja":"傷物語〈Ⅱ熱血篇〉"},"synopsis":"No longer truly human, Koyomi Araragi decides to retrieve Kiss-shot Acerola-orion Heart-under-blade's severed body parts that were stolen by three powerful vampire hunters. Awaiting him are Dramaturgie, a vampire hunter who is a vampire himself; Episode, a half-vampire with the ability to transform into mist; and Guillotinecutter, a human priest who is the most dangerous of them all.\n\nUnbeknownst to Araragi, each minute he spends trying to retrieve Kiss-shot's limbs makes him less of a human and more of a vampire. Will he be able to keep his wish of becoming human once again by the end of his battles?\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Koyomi Araragi, que ya no es verdaderamente humana, decide recuperar las partes cortadas del cuerpo de Kiss-shot Acerola-orion Heart-under-blade que fueron robadas por tres poderosos cazadores de vampiros. Lo esperan Dramaturgie, un cazador de vampiros que también es vampiro; Episodio, un medio vampiro con la capacidad de transformarse en niebla; y Guillotinecutter, un sacerdote humano que es el más peligroso de todos.\n\nSin que Araragi lo sepa, cada minuto que pasa tratando de recuperar las extremidades de Kiss-shot lo hace menos humano y más vampiro. ¿Podrá cumplir su deseo de volver a ser humano al final de sus batallas?\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"Movie","media_type":"movie","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":4093,"average_episode_duration":4093,"startDate":"2016-08-19","start_date":"2016-08-19","endDate":"2016-08-19","end_date":"2016-08-19","season":"summer","year":2016,"start_season":{"year":2016,"season":"summer"},"episodes":1,"num_episodes":1,"score":8.56,"mean":8.56,"